    "text": "By KSNB Local4 ,\n1 days ago RED CLOUD, Neb. (KSNB) - Red Cloud Community Schools announced Thursday the death of one of its elementary students. A social media post written to Red Cloud families said, “it is with a very heavy heart that we share the news of the passing of one of our second-grade students.” Read full article",
